{"lyrics":"[00:03.22]She said she need somebody to confide to\n[00:06.88]Don’t find me, I’ll find you\n[00:10.32]You don’t got wings like I do\n[00:13.06]So if you jump off this cliff who gon’ catch you?\n[00:16.94]She tell me she need someone to confide to\n[00:20.36]But don’t find me I’ll find you\n[00:24.06]You don’t got wings like I do\n[00:27.18]You jump off this cliff who gon’ catch you?\n[00:32.42]I caught your attention, oh\n[00:35.76]You’re all in my mentions, oh\n[00:39.34]I know you’ve been tripping too\n[00:42.64]But I’ve been tripping off the shrooms\n[00:45.92]And I don’t know what these pills do\n[00:49.52]But I’m gon’ take two\n[00:52.60]I’m starting to feel you\n[00:55.58]I guess it’s time to kill you\n[00:59.10]Yeah I don’t know what these pills do\n[01:03.22]But I’m about to take two\n[01:06.90]Don’t find me I’ll find you\n[01:10.32]You don’t got wings like I do\n[01:13.04]So if you jump off this cliff suicidal\n[01:18.88]Oh-oh, oh-oh-oh\n[01:22.32]Me in first, running shit, we in first place (Yeah)\n[01:25.74]May just have to run it back, like a relay\n[01:29.30]I remember stealing shit, all on eBay\n[01:32.72]I remember cracking cards, no pre-paid (Ayy)\n[01:36.44]Now a nigga rich enough to buy you (Huh, uh)\n[01:40.22].40 on me leave you in the bayou (Huh, uh)\n[01:43.28]Brother serving bricks like a drive-thru (Huh, uh)\n[01:46.70]Trap house blocked off, nigga you can’t ride through\n[01:49.92]She said she need somebody to confide to\n[01:53.60]Don’t come find me, bae I’ll find you\n[01:56.52]Keep it on the low you know I gotta hide you\n[01:59.66]Can you feel it? When the midnight wolves howl\n[02:05.58]When the midnight wolves prowl? Yeah, yeah\n[02:12.42]Can you feel it? When the midnight wolves prowl\n[02:21.46]When the midnight wolves howl, better not make a sound\n[02:26.10]Can you hear it? When the midnight wolves howl\n[02:31.32]When the midnight wolves prowl, In the midnight hours\n[02:39.86]Do you feel me? Vibrations of mine\n[02:45.02]Get low when I’m high, I’m not that guy, yeah\n[02:53.54]Can you hear me? Am I talking too low?\n[02:58.34]Are my expectations too high? I’m not that guy\n[03:07.26]Can you feel it? When the midnight wolves howl\n[03:11.66]I just left her, like I bought a new whip\n[03:14.96]Got away like she was on a cruise ship\n[03:18.42]Niggas acting on that Terry Crews shit\n[03:21.98]I don’t got no time for that fake shit I lose it\n[03:25.28]Say you wanna fight, I’ll leave him tooth-less\n[03:28.68]Kinda like my car, I’ll leave him roof-less\n[03:31.10]I know I’m a dog, nigga Rufus\n[03:34.94]I’m living in the moment, listening to Guns N’ Roses\n[03:41.60]Got a closet full of guns n’ roses\n[03:44.66]Only nineteen with the millions in my bank account\n[03:47.98]So much money, damn, ion even think the back could count","words":[[3.22,3.28,"She"],[3.42,3.6,"said"],[3.66,3.74,"she"],[3.86,4.0,"need"],[4.06,4.6,"somebody"],[4.72,4.8,"to"],[4.88,5.5,"confide"],[5.54,5.64,"to"],[6.88,7.12,"Don’t"],[7.26,7.64,"find"],[7.72,7.78,"me,"],[7.94,8.44,"I’ll"],[8.54,8.9,"find"],[9.02,9.1,"you"],[10.32,10.46,"You"],[10.5,10.66,"don’t"],[10.72,10.92,"got"],[11.14,11.46,"wings"],[11.6,11.9,"like"],[12.28,12.28,"I"],[12.42,12.5,"do"],[13.06,13.14,"So"],[13.36,13.46,"if"],[13.52,13.6,"you"],[13.7,13.98,"jump"],[14.08,14.18,"off"],[14.28,14.46,"this"],[14.54,14.88,"cliff"],[14.92,15.04,"who"],[15.14,15.3,"gon’"],[15.4,15.84,"catch"],[15.9,16.04,"you?"],[16.94,17.0,"She"],[17.14,17.3,"tell"],[17.36,17.42,"me"],[17.56,17.66,"she"],[17.78,17.88,"need"],[18.0,18.38,"someone"],[18.42,18.5,"to"],[18.58,19.16,"confide"],[19.24,19.36,"to"],[20.36,20.46,"But"],[20.58,20.82,"don’t"],[20.98,21.36,"find"],[21.44,21.52,"me"],[21.64,22.1,"I’ll"],[22.26,22.64,"find"],[22.74,22.82,"you"],[24.06,24.16,"You"],[24.22,24.38,"don’t"],[24.44,24.62,"got"],[24.88,25.2,"wings"],[25.3,25.64,"like"],[26.0,26.0,"I"],[26.12,26.22,"do"],[27.18,27.24,"You"],[27.44,27.72,"jump"],[27.82,27.98,"off"],[28.02,28.2,"this"],[28.3